  "notes": "Version 3 = version 2 with one rule moved: the unconditional rule for the deck's large creatures and permanents (Grave Titan to Dread Tiller, twenty cards) now stands above the rule for the draw spells (Painful Truths, Harmonize, Night's Whisper, Hoarder's Greed, Burning Curiosity) instead of three rules below it. Why: at the owner's table (ab-run #42, 200 tables) version 2 cast nineteen cards fifteen points less often than its stock pilot, nearly all of them the creatures of four to seven mana this rule names (Carnifex Demon 27 of the 64 games it was drawn against the stock pilot's 43 of 52, Puppeteer Clique 35 of 75 against 48 of 56, The Scorpion God 25 of 61 against 33 of 47), cast Painful Truths in 53 of 67 against 22 of 57 with five and six cards in hand, and held 4.5 nonland cards when it lost, 4.3 of them affordable. Nothing else is changed."
